ProjT Launcher - Project Tick
=============================

NOTE: Infrastructure transition in progress

ProjT Launcher is currently migrating its primary development
infrastructure from GitHub to a self-hosted stack based on
gitolite and cgit.

GitHub repositories are used as mirrors and for transitional
CI workflows only. The authoritative source of truth is:

https://git.projecttick.org.tr/projt-launcher.git

A Minecraft launcher and automation stack that helps maintainers avoid missed
updates, security drift, and broken metadata in long-lived projects.

A fork of Prism Launcher, diverging on purpose to keep maintenance and infrastructure
healthy over time. Built for projects that rely on CI, automation, and long-term maintenance,
often maintained by small teams or individuals.

----------------------------------------------------------------------

Projects
--------

This repo is a monorepo with the launcher and the pieces that keep it running:

- Launcher app (C++/Qt): launcher/, CMakeLists.txt
- Website (Eleventy): website/, public/, package.json
- Automation bot (Cloudflare Workers): bot/
- Metadata generator (Python/Poetry): meta/, pyproject.toml
- Docs/CI/Tools: docs/, ci/, .github/workflows/, scripts/, tools/
- Forked libraries: bzip2/, quazip/, zlib/, libnbtplusplus/
- Bundled libraries: gamemode/, LocalPeer/, murmur2/, qdcss/, rainbow/, systeminfo/
- Non-Fork libraries: launcherjava/

WARNING:
Forks are expected; large rebundling or CI changes should clearly document intent.

